  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“I’ve got friends in high places.”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Kineticist 5th, elemental focus class feature (air, earth, fire, or water), ability to summon creatures with a spell-like ability or access to an animal companion, eidolon, or familiar.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Creatures you summon receive a subtype matching your elemental focus. This also applies to any animal companions, eidolons, or familiars you control. Creatures who already have that subtype instead gain an additional 1 HP per hit die.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc53\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
